From a3ed3151253fc1c07cfc66a231349babec05e23d Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: TEX8 Monero Patch Integrator <monero-patches@tex8.local>
Date: Thu, 20 Aug 2026 18:03:10 -0500
Subject: [PATCH] wallet: batch Ledger history lookup and retain key images

Keep successful Ledger key-image derivations as a durable checkpoint before
trusted-node spent-status and outgoing-history RPCs. A node failure can then
retry entirely from the encrypted view wallet without reopening the hardware.

Restricted Monero nodes accept at most 100 transaction hashes per
/gettransactions request. Split deferred outgoing-history candidates into
bounded batches, merge their replies, and retain the existing complete
membership validation.

